    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goddess of vanity has issued you a dangerous challenge. Win, and you rescue your imprisoned companions; lose, and you are stripped of your humanity to become a plaything in her hands. Life and liberty are at stake\u2014will you beat her at her own game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cubic Cosmos brings you a unique roguelike deckbuilding experience, where tower-defense gameplay and fast-paced, hard-hitting card battles collide to create unparalleled strategic depth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight Fate With Every Choice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to wage war or explore random events\u2014every step could change your destiny.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ cards with dozens of possible strategic combinations.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ relics, each one crucial to your deckbuilding strategy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ random events.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete runs to unlock various heroes with unique strategic abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/2c4766024e88c9a0f7b60175bc870349.poster.avif?t=1751274867\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/2c4766024e88c9a0f7b60175bc870349.webm?t=1751274867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/2c4766024e88c9a0f7b60175bc870349.mp4?t=1751274867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build an Unbeatable Deck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pair relics with cards to enjoy deep strategic deckbuilding gameplay.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of Strategic Combinations: Focus on powerful pawns, deadly sorceries, or mysterious relics. Shield your pawns from harm, or let their death strengthen your forces... the possibilities are endless!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lasting Improvements: Cards can gain permanent increases to their attributes through a variety of methods. Through constant improvement, even the weakest of pawns can become powerful warriors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/7fd04b72c1e5ac17e37ca7cec7e629ef.poster.avif?t=1751274867\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/7fd04b72c1e5ac17e37ca7cec7e629ef.webm?t=1751274867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/7fd04b72c1e5ac17e37ca7cec7e629ef.mp4?t=1751274867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain Reactions: Cards have unique effects that can set off a deadly cascade of skills\u2014sit back and watch the show!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/4cbbf4315d32cbcdc7d73fcf08af5e03.poster.avif?t=1751274867\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/4cbbf4315d32cbcdc7d73fcf08af5e03.webm?t=1751274867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/4cbbf4315d32cbcdc7d73fcf08af5e03.mp4?t=1751274867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Share the Challenge, Share the Glory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record and share your battles, and climb to the top of the rankings!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record Your Battles<strong>: </strong>Generate run seeds and battle codes to share your finest moments and relive your greatest fights!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the Rankings<strong>: </strong>Receive 'likes' from other players for incredible performances and fight your way to the top!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Your Friends<strong>: </strong>Share your battle code to help your friends and receive aid in return. Synchronize your progress and witness the power of friendship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/fd83c3e237d8afd4c6695702f0c2bfd9.poster.avif?t=1751274867\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/fd83c3e237d8afd4c6695702f0c2bfd9.webm?t=1751274867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/fd83c3e237d8afd4c6695702f0c2bfd9.mp4?t=1751274867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goddess of vanity has issued you a dangerous challenge. Win, and you rescue your imprisoned companions; lose, and you are stripped of your humanity to become a plaything in her hands. Life and liberty are at stake\u2014will you beat her at her own game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cubic Cosmos brings you a unique roguelike deckbuilding experience, where tower-defense gameplay and fast-paced, hard-hitting card battles collide to create unparalleled strategic depth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight Fate With Every Choice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to wage war or explore random events\u2014every step could change your destiny.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ cards with dozens of possible strategic combinations.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ relics, each one crucial to your deckbuilding strategy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ random events.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete runs to unlock various heroes with unique strategic abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/2c4766024e88c9a0f7b60175bc870349.poster.avif?t=1751274867\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/2c4766024e88c9a0f7b60175bc870349.webm?t=1751274867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/2c4766024e88c9a0f7b60175bc870349.mp4?t=1751274867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build an Unbeatable Deck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pair relics with cards to enjoy deep strategic deckbuilding gameplay.</p