 Challenge, Share the Glory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record and share your battles, and climb to the top of the rankings!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record Your Battles<strong>: </strong>Generate run seeds and battle codes to share your finest moments and relive your greatest fights!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the Rankings<strong>: </strong>Receive 'likes' from other players for incredible performances and fight your way to the top!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Your Friends<strong>: </strong>Share your battle code to help your friends and receive aid in return. Synchronize your progress and witness the power of friendship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/fd83c3e237d8afd4c6695702f0c2bfd9.poster.avif?t=1751274867\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/fd83c3e237d8afd4c6695702f0c2bfd9.webm?t=1751274867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332600/extras/fd83c3e237d8afd4c6695702f0c2bfd9.mp4?t=1751274867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
